# Storage override only; env_sample remains the complete Site configuration template.
# Unset retains private_data/experimental-models; do not set an empty value.
# Replace this placeholder with an operator-approved absolute protected directory.
# Windows may use C:/absolute/protected/path/experimental-models (not a security claim).
# Requires restart and existing private-storage/ACL checks; see documentation/experimental-models.md.
# EXPERIMENTAL_MODELS_STORAGE_ROOT=/absolute/protected/path/experimental-models
